{"id":"n81267-1-7","stage":5,"title":"통조림 · 罐头","scene":"餐饮与生活","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n81267-1-7-1","ko":"혹시 과일 사다 놓은 거 있니?","zh":"你有买水果放着吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"혹시","meaning":"是不是，是否","explanation":"혹시：是不是，是否。","readings":[{"term":"혹시","audio":"/audio/c99406fc3132c80df65d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"87955","senseId":"4","lemma":"혹시","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"혹시","audio":"/audio/c99406fc3132c80df65d.mp3"}},{"text":"과일","meaning":"水果","explanation":"과일：水果。","readings":[{"term":"과일","audio":"/audio/ed0e90733d1a21cf0b03.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18264","senseId":"1","lemma":"과일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"과일","audio":"/audio/ed0e90733d1a21cf0b03.mp3"}},{"text":"사다","meaning":"买，购买","explanation":"사다：买，购买；다：连接途中转换或接续的动作，具体要结合前后文。","readings":[{"term":"사다","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49419","senseId":"1","lemma":"사다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사다","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3"}},{"text":"놓은","meaning":"表示前面所指的行为结束后其结果仍持续。","explanation":"놓다：表示前面所指的行为结束后其结果仍持续；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"놓다","audio":"/audio/bac7d20277d64d673e40.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72578","senseId":"1","lemma":"놓다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"놓은","audio":"/audio/269721ea83189783919a.mp3"}},{"text":"거","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}},{"text":"있니?","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"1","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있니","audio":"/audio/5cc802647eea2944ec84.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"c99406fc3132c80d","term":"혹시","zh":"是不是，是否","audio":"/audio/c99406fc3132c80df65d.mp3","entryId":"87955","definition":"用于对不确定的事情提出疑问，表示虽认为如此，但因不确定而犹豫要不要说。","pronunciation":["혹씨"]},{"id":"ed0e90733d1a21cf","term":"과일","zh":"水果","audio":"/audio/ed0e90733d1a21cf0b03.mp3","entryId":"18264","definition":"苹果、梨、葡萄、栗子等主要长在树上的，人们可以食用的果子。","pronunciation":["과ː일"]},{"id":"ee0ee072926e06fc","term":"사다","zh":"买，购买","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3","entryId":"49419","definition":"用钱使某种东西或权利为己所有。","pronunciation":["사다"]},{"id":"bac7d20277d64d67","term":"놓다","zh":"表示前面所指的行为结束后其结果仍持续。","audio":"/audio/bac7d20277d64d673e40.mp3","entryId":"72578","definition":"表示前面所指的行为结束后其结果仍持续。","pronunciation":["노타"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、现象或事实。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、现象或事实。","pronunciation":["거"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"有","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"人或动物、物体等存在的状态。","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/f1a136ce8721a4bee4ae.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n81267-1-7-2","ko":"지금 있는 과일은 냉장고에 있는 복숭아 통조림밖에 없어.","zh":"现在有的水果就只有冰箱里的桃子罐头而已。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"지금","meaning":"现在","explanation":"지금：现在。","readings":[{"term":"지금","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62522","senseId":"1","lemma":"지금","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지금","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3"}},{"text":"있는","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"1","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있는","audio":"/audio/9714c770db7ebcb9f4f1.mp3"}},{"text":"과일은","meaning":"水果","explanation":"과일：水果；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"과일","audio":"/audio/ed0e90733d1a21cf0b03.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18264","senseId":"1","lemma":"과일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"과일은","audio":"/audio/8952a305ff8408bac49f.mp3"}},{"text":"냉장고에","meaning":"冰箱","explanation":"냉장고：冰箱；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"냉장고","audio":"/audio/b3bf31f65841d3e1822e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31524","senseId":"1","lemma":"냉장고","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"냉장고에","audio":"/audio/5908e5f7eb6dd820ecf9.mp3"}},{"text":"있는","meaning":"在","explanation":"있다：在；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"8","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있는","audio":"/audio/9714c770db7ebcb9f4f1.mp3"}},{"text":"복숭아","meaning":"桃子","explanation":"복숭아：桃子。","readings":[{"term":"복숭아","audio":"/audio/c4cd786252046269bf32.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14543","senseId":"1","lemma":"복숭아","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"복숭아","audio":"/audio/c4cd786252046269bf32.mp3"}},{"text":"통조림밖에","meaning":"罐头","explanation":"통조림：罐头；밖에：与否定表达合用，表示“只有、除……之外没有”。","readings":[{"term":"통조림","audio":"/audio/93cb5b4ac56f1d29a8cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"81267","senseId":"1","lemma":"통조림","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"통조림밖에","audio":"/audio/d548ef2bef80d16a2191.mp3"}},{"text":"없어.","meaning":"没有","explanation":"없다：没有；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"1","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"없어","audio":"/audio/d3275bf98baed4550c12.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"df159f47a890ff65","term":"지금","zh":"现在","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3","entryId":"62522"